   ("bolt", "Make it safe", "Turn off power to wet areas at the breaker, from a dry spot. Never step into water near outlets."),
   ("drop", "Stop the water", "Shut the main valve. Know where it is before you need it."),
   ("clock", "Watch the clock", "The EPA says wet materials should be dried within 24 to 48 hours to prevent mold."),
   ("home", "Move what matters", "Lift rugs, electronics and papers off wet floors."),
